  "description": "Usage of the public flight map (~/flightdensity, flightdensity-public). Counts views and settings, plus daily unique visitors from salted hashes that are never stored - no visitor or location data. Views answered from Cloudflare's cache don't reach the server, so these undercount repeat views."
}